# Synthetic pose traces are regenerated deterministically by the test suite (see
# test-fixtures/README.md). Only *recorded* traces are committed. The expected-event
# goldens under test-fixtures/expected-events/ ARE committed — they are the regression signal.
test-fixtures/pose-traces/*_synthetic_*.jsonl
